    "body": "Add a V-key toggle for first-person view. Inspect the downloaded First Person mod from Nexus #277 and the installed camera RPF data as the primary reference; do not copy guessed RDR2 camera settings. Keep a reversible third-person state and recover across death, loading, cutscenes, cover, riding, and plugin shutdown. Acceptance: one V press enters first person, the next returns to the prior third-person camera, aiming and movement remain usable, and invalid transitions fail closed without leaving the camera stuck.",
